---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Why This Exists" description="The story behind Belongary — and the warning nobody got.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-plum mb-8">Why this exists</h1>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        I started a job once where my manager was fired the Friday before my first day.
      </p>

      <p>
        She was a Black woman. That was part of why I took the role.
      </p>

      <p>
        I spent those first weeks quiet, trying to understand what I'd walked into. No one said hello. They sat me in a row by myself. I overheard two colleagues in the break room guessing how long I'd last — <em>that girl probably won't even make it past three months.</em>
      </p>

      <p>
        Months later, when I finally told the other Black employees what that had been like, not one of them was surprised.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg font-heading font-semibold text-plum">
        That's the part I couldn't get past. Not the coldness — the fact that everyone already knew, and there was no way for any of them to tell me before I signed.
      </p>

      <p>
        I've spent my career in HR and L&D. I've run employee resource groups. I've watched capable people get quietly closed out until they left on their own, and called it turnover. I've stayed quiet about things to keep my own job while I found my way out. I know what this looks like from every side of the table, including the side where I was the one being managed out.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg font-heading font-semibold text-plum">
        Belongary is the warning I never got.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 text-center">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3 bg-coral text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-coral/90 transition-colors shadow-sm">
          Share Your Story
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
